# Production build (`vite build`, mode "production") — committed on purpose: it holds no secret.
# The deployed app calls its own origin; the Cloudflare Worker forwards /api/* to Render, which
# keeps the session cookie first-party (Safari blocks third-party cookies).
# Never put secrets here: every VITE_ variable is embedded in the public bundle.
# A VITE_API_BASE_URL set in the build environment (e.g. a Cloudflare build variable) overrides
# this file, so Workers Builds refuses any value other than /api (deploy/build-guard.ts).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
